<!--
  The small icon in the status bar. Android throws away every colour in it and
  keeps only the alpha, drawing whatever is left as a flat silhouette — so the
  shop's logo cannot be used here. At 24dp its mark would collapse into a blob.
  A shopping bag survives the treatment and still says what the app is.
-->
